        <li><b>Click any heading</b>, then open <em>✎ Edit text</em> and rewrite it. The old text is already there.</li>
        <li><b>Shift-click three cards</b>, or drag a box around them, and write one note for the group.</li>
        <li><b>Hover anything</b> and press <em>↑</em> to grab its container instead. The label shows what you're aiming at.</li>
        <li><b>Drag a popup</b> by its title bar if it's in your way.</li>
